---
source: crates/krishiv-exec/tests/planner/smj_order.rs
expression: plan
---
Sort [o_orderkey#0 ASC NULLS FIRST]
+- Exchange rangepartitioning(o_orderkey#0 ASC NULLS FIRST)
   +- Project [o_orderkey#0, l_linenumber#12]
      +- SortMergeJoin FullOuter, [o_orderkey#0] = [l_orderkey#9]
         :- Sort [o_orderkey#0]
         :  +- Exchange hashpartitioning(o_orderkey#0)
         :     +- Scan spark_catalog.default.orders [o_orderkey#0]
         +- Sort [l_orderkey#9]
            +- Exchange hashpartitioning(l_orderkey#9)
               +- Scan spark_catalog.default.lineitem [l_orderkey#9, l_linenumber#12]
